OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fshowers. Showers frequent by the
OL,7,Fafternoon, some heavy with hail and
OL,8,Fthunder, which may lead to some
OL,9,Flocalised flooding in places. Gusty
OL,10,Fwinds with some of the showers.
OL,11,FFeeling rather muggy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FFurther heavy and thundery
OL,14,Fshowers are expected through the
OL,15,Fevening, though slowly easing
OL,16,Fovernight with clear spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping. Staying mild, with a few
OL,18,Fmist patches forming by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
