OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FShowers return for the
OL,6,Fmorning, but these should generally
OL,7,Fclear for most during the afternoon,
OL,8,Fas a ridge of high pressure moves in.
OL,9,FFeeling fresher, with a northwesterly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FStaying on the mixed side, with
OL,14,Ffurther showers and longer spells of
OL,15,Frain through this period. Some sunnier
OL,16,Fmoments in between. Temperatures
OL,17,Faround average for early
OL,18,Fmeteorological Autumn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
